WEBVTT

00:00:16.875 --> 00:00:22.250
My name is Alice!
Integrity Knight Alice Synthesis Thirty!

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:27.125
Proxy of the three gods who protect the
Human Empire, the Priestess of Light!

00:00:27.125 --> 00:00:30.917
All those who stand before me,
brace for my holy authority

00:00:30.917 --> 00:00:33.375
to vanquish every last one of you!

00:00:35.708 --> 00:00:37.708
Alice.

00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:41.625
Alicia.

00:00:43.625 --> 00:00:48.792
This time... This time I have to capture her!

00:00:48.792 --> 00:00:53.208
I have to seize the Lightcube
where that girl's Fluctlight is stored,

00:00:53.208 --> 00:00:57.292
and savor it to my heart's content.

00:00:57.292 --> 00:01:00.250
All troops, prepare to move!

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:07.000
With the pugilists guild in the lead, followed by
the dark mages guild and the supply corps, head south!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:11.667
Capture that knight,
the Priestess of Light, unscathed!

00:02:48.042 --> 00:02:52.042
"Sword and Fist"

00:03:07.667 --> 00:03:13.708
The Dark God Vecta sure seems obsessed with you.

00:03:13.708 --> 00:03:16.750
He's planning to come after you
with his entire army.

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.583
I suppose we should be happy about that.

00:03:19.583 --> 00:03:23.083
It's better than being ignored, at least.

00:03:23.083 --> 00:03:25.625
So about our strategy going forward.

00:03:25.625 --> 00:03:30.917
The raid unit and I will keep leading the enemy away,
and reduce their force's numbers.

00:03:30.917 --> 00:03:32.833
Does that sound right?

00:03:32.833 --> 00:03:36.250
Yes. We've already annihilated half
of the invading forces,

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:39.583
which leaves only the enemy's main force
of the dark knights and the pugilists.

00:03:39.583 --> 00:03:44.042
We'll wear them down to a certain point,
and if we can defeat the Dark God Vecta,

00:03:44.042 --> 00:03:49.250
it's highly likely that the remaining enemies
will be open to a truce.

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:55.167
The problem is, who will be leading
the enemy when that happens?

00:03:55.167 --> 00:03:58.250
If only that Shasta brat were alive.

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:02.333
Uncle, you think the dark general
is already dead?

00:04:02.333 --> 00:04:06.667
Yeah. I can't detect him
in the main enemy force.

00:04:06.667 --> 00:04:09.750
I did have a feeling that maybe...

00:04:14.917 --> 00:04:17.375
Allow me to report, my lord Knight Commander.

00:04:17.375 --> 00:04:20.792
There'll be no problem using the designated spot
in the south for our ambush.

00:04:20.792 --> 00:04:22.917
All right. Thanks for checking.

00:04:22.917 --> 00:04:26.083
Have the units prepare to move out.

00:04:26.083 --> 00:04:29.250
Your dragon must be exhausted.

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:32.125
Be sure to give it plenty of food and water.

00:04:32.125 --> 00:04:33.542
Yes, sir!

00:04:37.917 --> 00:04:38.958
Uncle?

00:04:38.958 --> 00:04:40.083
Oh, it's just that...

00:04:40.083 --> 00:04:45.083
Robbing people of their memories,
and freezing their life to create Integrity Knights...

00:04:45.083 --> 00:04:50.417
I agree the Synthesis Ritual
shouldn't be allowed.

00:04:50.417 --> 00:04:57.583
But it'll be a shame not to have young fellows
like him joining the order anymore, you know?

00:04:57.583 --> 00:05:03.333
I don't believe that having
your memory altered and your life frozen

00:05:03.333 --> 00:05:06.750
is the only way to become
an Integrity Knight, Uncle.

00:05:08.417 --> 00:05:13.708
Even if none of us
are left standing, our souls...

00:05:13.708 --> 00:05:17.417
...our purpose will be inherited
by those who come after us.

00:05:17.417 --> 00:05:19.667
That's what I believe.

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:33.958
Something's coming.

00:05:37.708 --> 00:05:40.000
That has to be the pugilists.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.208
They're going to be a handful.

00:05:42.208 --> 00:05:49.000
They'll gladly take injuries from a bare fist,
but they absolutely refuse to be slashed with a sword.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:50.500
What? Refuse?

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:54.042
The more training those pugilists undergo,

00:05:54.042 --> 00:05:57.292
the more they're convinced
"a blade is nothing to be afraid of."

00:05:57.292 --> 00:05:59.292
That becomes their willpower,

00:05:59.292 --> 00:06:04.083
and they literally harden their physical bodies
to deflect any blade.

00:06:04.083 --> 00:06:08.958
Either way, we'll need to prepare ourselves
to defend against them.

00:06:11.083 --> 00:06:13.458
I shall go.

00:06:29.375 --> 00:06:34.000
Pretty soon, I'll get to fight an Integrity
Knight... someone powerful!

00:06:43.833 --> 00:06:47.583
Who the hell are you? What are you doing there?

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:58.500
I'm here... to keep you from advancing.

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:01.583
You couldn't even stop one brat.

00:07:01.583 --> 00:07:06.292
Or wait... are you a knight
who can only cast arts?

00:07:07.667 --> 00:07:10.375
I'm not skilled in the formal arts.

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:13.167
Whatever.

00:07:13.167 --> 00:07:14.750
Yotte, fight her.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:16.250
You got it!

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:22.292
Only one?

00:07:22.292 --> 00:07:25.417
That's what I'm saying, you beanpole!

00:07:25.417 --> 00:07:27.875
Shut up and draw your sword!

00:07:36.583 --> 00:07:38.667
What the hell is that?

00:07:41.417 --> 00:07:44.250
Don't mess with me!

00:08:05.917 --> 00:08:09.625
I'm told that you always keep to yourself.

00:08:09.625 --> 00:08:11.833
Why is that?

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:17.375
You don't care for other people? Or...

00:08:17.375 --> 00:08:20.708
...are you afraid that you'll
end up slashing them?

00:08:22.625 --> 00:08:26.750
Your desire to slash is written
all over your face.

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:30.417
You'd like to slash everything in sight.

00:08:30.417 --> 00:08:34.500
It's like you're cursed
with a murderous impulse.

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:38.292
Oh, not that I'm scolding you.

00:08:38.292 --> 00:08:43.167
And besides, I'm sure this is
quite good news for you.

00:08:44.625 --> 00:08:51.583
You brought this back from your last
reconnaissance mission of the Dark Territory.

00:08:51.583 --> 00:08:56.875
This flower has absorbed massive amounts of the
spatial resources generated on the battlefield.

00:08:56.875 --> 00:08:59.583
I'm going to turn it into your Divine Object.

00:08:59.583 --> 00:09:04.292
A sword with the highest priority
that can slash anything.

00:09:16.333 --> 00:09:22.125
This sword is a manifestation
of the curse carved into your soul.

00:09:22.125 --> 00:09:29.542
A curse known as "murderous impulse," created by the
distortion of your inherited characteristic parameters.

00:09:29.542 --> 00:09:32.792
Slash... slash... slash on and on.

00:09:32.792 --> 00:09:38.333
Only at the end of that blood-smeared path
will you find the key to breaking your curse.

00:09:38.333 --> 00:09:40.458
At least, you might.

00:09:56.625 --> 00:09:59.250
What a savage style of fighting.

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:05.292
That said, for how violent her attacks are, I'm not
detecting a murderous impulse from Lady Sheyta.

00:10:05.292 --> 00:10:07.708
Not even hostility.

00:10:07.708 --> 00:10:09.292
Don't think about it.

00:10:09.292 --> 00:10:14.167
I've known her for over a hundred years,
and I still have no idea what she's thinking.

00:10:14.167 --> 00:10:15.917
Not a clue.

00:10:15.917 --> 00:10:18.667
It's fine if we leave this to her.

00:10:18.667 --> 00:10:22.083
The enemy's main force will catch up soon.

00:10:22.083 --> 00:10:26.708
We have to get ready for their attack.

00:10:26.708 --> 00:10:27.875
Yes, sir.

00:10:39.208 --> 00:10:41.042
The units are in position.

00:10:41.042 --> 00:10:42.292
Okay.

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:48.917
According to the knight commander,
the pugilists are vulnerable to the sacred arts.

00:10:48.917 --> 00:10:52.542
There might not be enough spatial resources
on the empty grasslands,

00:10:52.542 --> 00:10:55.000
but since there's some growth here,

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:59.333
the monks should have enough sacred power
to launch a concerted attack.

00:10:59.333 --> 00:11:04.708
And then if we can use our five dragons
to burn the confused enemy forces...

00:11:07.125 --> 00:11:08.875
That reminds me, where's the Supply Corps?

00:11:08.875 --> 00:11:10.125
Sir.

00:11:10.125 --> 00:11:14.917
They're standing by at a distance from the front
lines, so as not to get caught in the battle.

00:11:14.917 --> 00:11:17.417
Got it. Thank you.

00:11:18.417 --> 00:11:21.292
"Dark Territory Shrubland
Human Army Supply Corps"

00:11:38.708 --> 00:11:41.083
"1 hour before the raid unit advanced"

00:11:41.083 --> 00:11:42.500
"1 hour before the raid unit advanced"
Hey, bro!

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:47.917
Isn't it about time we stop delegating
and wreak a little havoc ourselves?

00:11:47.917 --> 00:11:51.625
Then you go and wreak some havoc first.

00:11:51.625 --> 00:11:53.625
Let's see...

00:11:55.417 --> 00:11:57.833
Stand by in these woods.

00:11:57.833 --> 00:12:01.625
So if I stay there, something fun will happen?

00:12:01.625 --> 00:12:05.917
Go and have fun. PK-ing, that is.

00:12:12.042 --> 00:12:14.458
Five down.

00:12:26.708 --> 00:12:30.292
Don't get so...

00:12:30.292 --> 00:12:33.417
...full of yourself, dammit!

00:12:38.708 --> 00:12:40.833
To my fists...

00:12:40.833 --> 00:12:43.500
...your armor is like paper!

00:13:13.042 --> 00:13:18.500
Damn you, woman, your appearance
is totally misleading, huh?

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:23.542
I'm... older than you.

00:13:23.542 --> 00:13:25.333
Well, of course you are.

00:13:25.333 --> 00:13:30.083
You Integrity Knights are monsters
that don't age for decades, right?

00:13:30.083 --> 00:13:33.792
So should I call you grandma instead?

00:13:34.958 --> 00:13:37.083
I'll allow it.

00:13:37.083 --> 00:13:40.167
Because you're remarkably hard.

00:13:40.167 --> 00:13:44.125
I can barely find any places to slash.

00:13:44.125 --> 00:13:45.750
What are you talking about?

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:51.542
Still, I guess all those rumors about the Integrity
Knights being crazy powerful like demons were true.

00:13:51.542 --> 00:13:54.958
Just look what you did to my comrades.

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:05.750
Damn you, you're holding back, aren't you?

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:12.292
Treating us like we're your training dummies...
That's unforgivable.

00:14:12.292 --> 00:14:15.292
No matter what, I'm going to crush you!

00:14:40.667 --> 00:14:44.792
Here I come!

00:14:54.667 --> 00:14:59.000
Don't think that the only move
a pugilist has is punching!

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:03.042
Take that!

00:15:21.208 --> 00:15:25.250
You're starting to look like a real fighter now.

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:28.458
But you don't have nearly enough muscles.

00:15:28.458 --> 00:15:31.375
Eat and train more, woman.

00:15:33.625 --> 00:15:39.083
You, too. Just now, you became a bit softer.

00:15:39.083 --> 00:15:42.958
What the hell did you say?
I'm not going easy on you anymore.

00:15:42.958 --> 00:15:46.708
I'm going to show you what's it like
when I go all-out!

00:15:46.708 --> 00:15:49.167
So you go all-out, too!

00:15:49.167 --> 00:15:52.708
And would you stop looking so sleepy?

00:15:58.583 --> 00:16:02.375
Well, that's the spirit... then.

00:16:02.375 --> 00:16:05.083
Yeah, that's the spirit.

00:16:39.292 --> 00:16:41.625
I've never fought anyone like her before.

00:16:41.625 --> 00:16:44.708
Seriously, she's getting me fired up!

00:16:57.583 --> 00:17:01.917
I wonder why I'm doing this?

00:17:01.917 --> 00:17:04.000
This pugilist's attack...

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:07.375
I was startled to see him display willpower
worthy of an elite knight,

00:17:07.375 --> 00:17:10.917
but he seemed soft everywhere
except his arms.

00:17:10.917 --> 00:17:15.958
Just cut off his head and finish it.
That's what I should do. But...

00:17:15.958 --> 00:17:19.792
It's unbelievably hard.
Will I be able to slash it?

00:17:20.875 --> 00:17:22.500
This is fun.

00:17:24.542 --> 00:17:29.917
What the hell? You couldn't look more frail, and
you're a well-bred lady from the Human Empire.

00:17:29.917 --> 00:17:32.917
But you're the same as me after all!

00:17:32.917 --> 00:17:36.250
No good, huh?
I'm getting overpowered here, too?

00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:37.792
Nothing I can do.

00:17:37.792 --> 00:17:41.667
Well, this isn't a bad way to die.

00:17:49.458 --> 00:17:52.458
Dampa! What the hell are you doing?

00:17:52.458 --> 00:17:56.500
Time's up, Champion.
The main force has caught up to us.

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:03.875
Woman! Don't think this means you've won!

00:18:05.292 --> 00:18:09.417
Calling me "woman"...
I want you to stop.

00:18:09.417 --> 00:18:10.667
Listen!

00:18:10.667 --> 00:18:14.292
First of all, how are you going to
get out of a situation like thi--

00:18:20.458 --> 00:18:22.458
You little...

00:18:22.458 --> 00:18:26.667
Hey! At least tell me your name
before you run off!

00:18:26.667 --> 00:18:31.167
I'm not running off. I am...

00:18:31.167 --> 00:18:34.000
...Sheyta Synthesis Twelve.

00:18:53.708 --> 00:18:57.875
That's right. Keep coming straight this way.

00:19:08.458 --> 00:19:11.458
Hey, baby. How'd you spot me?

00:19:11.458 --> 00:19:16.417
My senpai taught me not to rely on my eyes,
but to sense everything.

00:19:16.417 --> 00:19:19.333
S-Senpai, did you say?

00:19:20.542 --> 00:19:23.292
Enemy attack! Enemy attack!

00:19:34.917 --> 00:19:38.333
You guys... time to work!

00:19:46.917 --> 00:19:48.375
The enemy's behind us?

00:19:48.375 --> 00:19:50.167
Dozens of them?

00:19:50.167 --> 00:19:53.958
This is bad! If they burn our supplies,
it would immobilize the whole army.

00:19:53.958 --> 00:19:57.042
Not to mention, those three are behind us.

00:19:57.042 --> 00:20:02.750
I should call for backup. But if we move the raid unit
now, it'll give away our strategy to the enemy.

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:05.917
No, our ambush has already
been compromised, right?

00:20:05.917 --> 00:20:07.833
Then we should send the entire force south--

00:20:07.833 --> 00:20:14.167
Who would've thought they figured out our
plan to head south, and placed soldiers here.

00:20:14.167 --> 00:20:15.958
My lord Knight Commander!

00:20:17.333 --> 00:20:18.792
Renly.

00:20:18.792 --> 00:20:20.750
Give the order to retreat.

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:24.333
Little one, rush over and help the Supply Corps.

00:20:24.333 --> 00:20:26.625
I'll hold off the enemy coming from the north.

00:20:26.625 --> 00:20:28.042
Yes, sir!

00:20:28.042 --> 00:20:29.583
You say you'll hold them off...

00:20:29.583 --> 00:20:34.333
...but Uncle, the enemy pugilist guild
numbers close to 5,000.

00:20:34.333 --> 00:20:38.583
Well, I'll find a way. Now get going!

00:20:38.583 --> 00:20:42.000
Uncle. Good luck.

00:20:52.875 --> 00:20:54.583
Ronie!

00:20:57.667 --> 00:21:00.458
This is it! This feeling!

00:21:00.458 --> 00:21:05.708
The pleasure from playing with someone's life,
their bonds, with the tip of your sword!

00:21:05.708 --> 00:21:09.833
No wonder I can't give up player killing!

00:21:20.083 --> 00:21:23.292
Lady... Stacia.

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:36.833
Wh-What's going on? The ground!

00:21:59.208 --> 00:22:02.792
Are you kidding me? Hey, are you kidding me?

00:22:02.792 --> 00:22:07.083
That face. That hair. That presence.

00:22:07.083 --> 00:22:12.708
That has to be the KoB's... "Lightning Flash"!

00:23:48.375 --> 00:23:52.150
Next time: "Stacia, the Goddess of Creation."
